$ install -o agent-admin -g agent-common -m 750 /tmp/agent-app-unzip/agent-app-linux-x86 /home/agent-admin/agent-app/agent-app && ls -l /home/agent-admin/agent-app/agent-app
-rwxr-x--- 1 agent-admin agent-common 6498144 Sep 15 13:37 /home/agent-admin/agent-app/agent-app

## root 로 실행하면 거부된다

$ cd /home/agent-admin/agent-app && timeout 5 ./agent-app 2>&1 | head -4
>>> Starting Agent Boot Sequence...
[1/5] Checking User Account               [FAIL]
   >>> Error: Running as 'root' is forbidden.
[2/5] Verifying Environment Variables     [FAIL]

## agent-admin 으로 실행
# 과제 원문은 포그라운드 실행 후 Ctrl+C 종료다. 자동화에서는 백그라운드로 띄우고 출력을 파일로 받는다.

agent-admin$ cd $AGENT_HOME; nohup ./agent-app > $AGENT_HOME/agent-app.out 2>&1 < /dev/null & echo "started (pid $!)"
started (pid 644)

$ sed -n '1,/Agent READY/p' /home/agent-admin/agent-app/agent-app.out
